      "_template": "rawHtml",
      "html": "\n\t\t<div class=\"wsite-section-content\">\n          <div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wsite-section-elements\">\n\t\t\t\t<div><div class=\"wsite-multicol\"><div class=\"wsite-multicol-table-wrap\" style=\"margin:0 -15px;\">\n\t<table class=\"wsite-multicol-table\">\n\t\t<tbody class=\"wsite-multicol-tbody\">\n\t\t\t<tr class=\"wsite-multicol-tr\">\n\t\t\t\t<td class=\"wsite-multicol-col\" style=\"width:50%; padding:0 15px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n<div><div class=\"wsite-image wsite-image-border-none \" style=\"padding-top:10px;padding-bottom:10px;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;text-align:center\">\n<a>\n<img src=\"uploads/1/1/2/9/112908841/31957693-10213666968722628-4370408211870646272-n_orig.jpg\" alt=\"Picture\" style=\"width:auto;max-width:100%\">\n</a>\n<div style=\"display:block;font-size:90%\"></div>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t<td class=\"wsite-multicol-col\" style=\"width:50%; padding:0 15px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n<div><div class=\"wsite-image wsite-image-border-none \" style=\"padding-top:10px;padding-bottom:10px;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;text-align:center\">\n<a>\n<img src=\"uploads/1/1/2/9/112908841/32072803-10213666979042886-209812352160235520-n_orig.jpg\" alt=\"Picture\" style=\"width:auto;max-width:100%\">\n</a>\n<div style=\"display:block;font-size:90%\"></div>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t</tbody>\n\t</table>\n</div></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"paragraph\"><span style=\"color:rgb(21, 30, 36)\"><font size=\"3\">The lodge is located in primary jungle of the Pacaya Samira National Reserve. Nearly 5 hours from the city of Iquitos.<br><br>Birds surround the property and life is abundantly living.&nbsp;</font></span><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"color:rgb(21, 30, 36)\">Hammocks and rocking chairs and an area to swim right at the front of our property</span><span style=\"color:rgb(21, 30, 36)\">.</span></font><br><font size=\"3\" color=\"#2a2a2a\">The lodge is equipped with 4 modern toilets and 4 showers for our&nbsp;guests.</font><br><br><font size=\"3\">&#8203;<span style=\"color:rgb(21, 30, 36)\">There are 4 tambos on the property. A tambo is the name used for sleeping quarters. Each tambo can accommodate 4 guests and allows privacy with aid of partitioning. There is a bed for each guest accompanied by mosquito net.&nbsp;<br>&#8203;</span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(21, 30, 36)\">There is no internet or electricity, though generator is used once a day to allow guests to charge their electronics.&nbsp;</span></font><br><br><font size=\"3\" style=\"color:rgb(21, 30, 36)\">&#8203;</font></div>\n\n<div><div class=\"wsite-multicol\"><div class=\"wsite-multicol-table-wrap\" style=\"margin:0 -15px;\">\n\t<table class=\"wsite-multicol-table\">\n\t\t<tbody class=\"wsite-multicol-tbody\">\n\t\t\t<tr class=\"wsite-multicol-tr\">\n\t\t\t\t<td class=\"wsite-multicol-col\" style=\"width:33.333333333333%; padding:0 15px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n<div><div class=\"wsite-image wsite-image-border-none \" style=\"padding-top:10px;padding-bottom:10px;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;text-align:center\">\n<a>\n<img src=\"uploads/1/1/2/9/112908841/published/day-1-gaia-tree-view.jpg?1531604400\" alt=\"Picture\" style=\"width:183;max-width:100%\">\n</a>\n<div style=\"display:block;font-size:90%\"></div>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t<td class=\"wsite-multicol-col\" style=\"width:33.333333333333%; padding:0 15px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n<div><div class=\"wsite-image wsite-image-border-none \" style=\"padding-top:10px;padding-bottom:10px;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;text-align:center\">\n<a>\n<img src=\"uploads/1/1/2/9/112908841/i281756464719590679-szw1280h1280_1_orig.jpg\" alt=\"Picture\" style=\"width:auto;max-width:100%\">\n</a>\n<div style=\"display:block;font-size:90%\"></div>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t<td class=\"wsite-multicol-col\" style=\"width:33.333333333333%; padding:0 15px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n<div><div class=\"wsite-image wsite-image-border-none \" style=\"padding-top:10px;padding-bottom:10px;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;text-align:left\">\n<a>\n<img src=\"uploads/1/1/2/9/112908841/published/21270931-1838326896497376-9134559773281599169-n_1.jpg?1531604134\" alt=\"Picture\" style=\"width:245;max-width:100%\">\n</a>\n<div style=\"display:block;font-size:90%\"></div>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t</tbody>\n\t</table>\n</div></div></div>\n\n<div><div class=\"wsite-image wsite-image-border-none \" style=\"padding-top:10px;padding-bottom:10px;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;text-align:center\">\n<a>\n<img src=\"uploads/1/1/2/9/112908841/published/37218846-10160582507210453-1121308814436466688-o_1.jpg?1532595783\" alt=\"Picture\" style=\"width:396;max-width:100%\">\n</a>\n<div style=\"display:block;font-size:90%\"></div>\n</div></div>\n\n<h2 class=\"wsite-content-title\"><font color=\"#508d24\">Food</font></h2>\n\n<div class=\"paragraph\"><font size=\"3\">Traditional (delicious) Peruvian cuisine is prepared daily. We will enjoy delicious food made by our chef, who specializes in vegetarian food.</font></div>\n\n<div><div class=\"wsite-image wsite-image-border-none \" style=\"padding-top:10px;padding-bottom:10px;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;text-align:center\">\n<a>\n<img src=\"uploads/1/1/2/9/112908841/img-0836_orig.jpg\" alt=\"Picture\" style=\"width:auto;max-width:100%\">\n</a>\n<div style=\"display:block;font-size:90%\"></div>\n</div></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n      </div>\n\n\t"
